################################
##RANDOM EFFECTS META-ANALYSIS##
################################

REMOVEFILTERS
SCHEME STDERR
USESTRAND OFF
GENOMICCONTROL OFF
AVERAGEFREQ OFF
MINMAXFREQ OFF
COLUMNCOUNTING LENIENT
SEPARATOR WHITESPACE
MARKER CPG
EFFECT BETA
PVALUELABEL PVALUE
STDERR SE
WEIGHT N

OUTFILE /Output/Metal.results .txt

PROCESSFILE      /Meta-analysis/Input/TopTable_Cohort1_forMETAL.txt
PROCESSFILE      /Meta-analysis/Input/TopTable_Cohort2_forMETAL.txt

ANALYZE RANDOM

CLEAR

